Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:00.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}偶爾因世態炎涼惱火
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:02.95,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}只是身在福中不知福
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:05.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}火光亮起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}指引方向
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.55,0:03:13.33,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}回憶中響起了溫柔旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:19.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:25.06,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}不妨坦然接受 嘗試微笑以對
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:29.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}燭華不吝照耀 光芒終將殆盡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:40.34,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們依舊奮勇直前 直到燃盡生命之火
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:43.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}發得出聲音的玩具也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:46.18,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}能吹飛疼痛的魔法也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:50.60,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}於我而言都是無價之寶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:55.73,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:04:06.14,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們仍然義無反顧 直到燃盡生命之火
